# Lance connector plugin configuration.
#
# build.sh seeds lance.conf from this file on first deploy and never overwrites it, so an upgrade that
# unzips a new plugin build over this directory keeps whatever you configured here.
# This file must exist on EVERY FE node -- it is not replicated through Doris metadata.
# Changes take effect after an FE restart.
#
# Every setting below is optional and falls back to the default named with it. fe.conf is not read for
# them: before Lance became a connector plugin, the setting below was an fe.conf key of the same name,
# and a value set there no longer takes effect -- move it here.

# Java Arrow memory, in bytes, that one Lance catalog may use while it reads dataset metadata
# (namespace listings, schemas, fragment lists). Must be positive. BE reads the data itself, so this
# does not bound query execution.
# Default: 268435456 (256 MiB)
# lance_catalog_arrow_memory_limit_bytes=268435456
